{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\"\n       xmlns:event=\"https://github.com/stateforward/scxml.rs/namespaces/event\"\n       version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" initial=\"idle\">\n  <state id=\"idle\">\n    <transition event=\"order\" target=\"done\"\n                event:schema='{\"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\", \"type\": \"object\"}'/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"done\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml091-event-schema-dialect.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml091-event-schema-dialect.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":84,"endLine":6,"startColumn":43,"startLine":6}}}],"message":{"markdown":"the inline schema of `<transition>` uses an unsupported JSON Schema dialect: unsupported `$schema` `http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#`\n\n**Note:** the supported dialects are JSON Schema 2020-12 (`https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema`, the default when `$schema` is absent), 2019-09 (`https://json-schema.org/draft/2019-09/schema`), and draft-07 (`http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#`)\n\n**Help:** declare one of the supported dialects in `$schema`, or remove `$schema` to use 2020-12\n\n**Spec:** JSON Schema 2020-12 Core","text":"the inline schema of `<transition>` uses an unsupported JSON Schema dialect: unsupported `$schema` `http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":333,"start":292},"category":"semantic"},"ruleId":"SCXML091"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"the supported dialects are JSON Schema 2020-12 (`https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema`, the default when `$schema` is absent), 2019-09 (`https://json-schema.org/draft/2019-09/schema`), and draft-07 (`http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#`); a schema whose dialect the compiler cannot check is rejected rather than embedded unchecked"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: declare a supported dialect in `$schema`, or remove `$schema` to use 2020-12.\n\nSpecification: JSON Schema 2020-12 Core §8.1.1 The $schema Keyword\n\nRun `scx --explain SCXML091` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/json-schema-core#section-8.1.1","id":"SCXML091","name":"SCXML091","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"an `event:schema` declares an unsupported JSON Schema dialect"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}